---
layout: base.njk
pageTitle: "Antalya Events & Festivals"
pageDescription: "Your guide to concerts, festivals and cultural events happening in Antalya, Turkey."
pageUrl: "/events/"
ogImage: "/images/photos/things-to-do-cover.jpg"
permalink: "/events/index.html"
schema:
  "@context": "https://schema.org"
  "@type": "CollectionPage"
  name: "Antalya Events & Festivals"
  url: "https://travel-antalya.com/events/"
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{% set cats = collections.eventCategories %}
{% set events = collections.events %}

<section style="padding:0;">
  <div class="detail-hero-media" style="aspect-ratio:21/8;">
    <img src="/images/photos/things-to-do-cover.jpg" alt="Antalya events and festivals">
  </div>
  <div class="container" style="padding-top:28px;">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> › Events</div>
    <span class="eyebrow">Events</span>
    <h1>Antalya Events &amp; Festivals</h1>
    <p class="lead" style="max-width:680px; font-size:1.1rem;">From ancient theatres hosting opera under the stars to harbor-side jazz nights — there's always something on in Antalya.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding-top:20px;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:820px;">
    <p style="font-size:1.02rem;">Antalya's calendar runs on a mix of ancient and modern: the <strong>Aspendos International Opera &amp; Ballet Festival</strong> fills a 2,000-year-old Roman theatre every summer, while the <strong>Antalya Golden Orange Film Festival</strong> — Turkey's oldest, running since 1963 — takes over the city's cinemas and public squares each October.</p>
    <p>Beyond the two headline festivals, expect a steady calendar of harbor-side concerts, seasonal beach club parties, and cultural events tied to Kaleiçi's old town. Whatever time of year you visit, check what's on below before you land.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ FIND YOUR EVENT (colored banner + category cards) ============ -->
<section class="highlight-banner">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow" style="color:#fff;">Find Your Event</span>
    <h2>What are you in the mood for?</h2>
    <div class="search-row">
      <input type="text" placeholder="I'm looking for…" disabled>
      <button type="button" disabled>Search</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding-top:40px;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid">
      {% for cat in cats %}
      <a href="/events/category/{{ cat.name | slugify }}/" class="card" style="text-decoration:none;">
        <div class="card-media"><span class="card-tag">{{ cat.events.length }} events</span>
          <img src="{{ cat.events[0].data.cover }}" alt="{{ cat.name }}">
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <h3>{{ cat.name }}</h3>
        </div>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ ALL EVENTS (horizontal listing) ============ -->
<section class="tint">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div><h2>All Upcoming Events</h2></div>
    </div>
    <p class="results-count">Showing {{ events.length }} events</p>

    {% for e in events %}
    <div class="listing-row">
      <div class="listing-row-media">
        <img src="{{ e.data.cover }}" alt="{{ e.data.title }}">
      </div>
      <div class="listing-row-body">
        <div class="listing-row-top">
          <div>
            <span class="badge badge-verified">{{ e.data.category }}</span>
            <h3 class="listing-row-title"><a href="/events/{{ e.data.title | slugify }}/">{{ e.data.title }}</a></h3>
          </div>
          <a href="/events/{{ e.data.title | slugify }}/" class="listing-row-arrow">↗</a>
        </div>
        <p class="listing-row-excerpt">{{ e.data.excerpt }}</p>
        <div class="listing-row-meta">
          <span>{{ e.data.date_display }}</span>
          <span>·</span>
          <span>{{ e.data.venue }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
